            "notes": "For Round 1 we want to take  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) as you'll want to farm damage and points for the first few rounds. Sometimes i swap between  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) and  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) depending on how i feel against their lineup (For example, if they have a reinhardt i will choose the extra ammo to help burst shield) \n\nYou'll want to try to stay alive while also doing as much damage as you can to farm those points, try to prioritize their support but also dont be afraid to shoot their tank as i said youll want to farm points.",
