            "created_at": "2025-08-25T15:47:28.514469+00:00",
            "notes": "By this round you should be dominating in any fifgt you get into, just rocket the floor and jump at the same time to get very high, and hold your shoot button and let the visor do most the damage, then you just need to aim to finish them off.\n\nIf you chose  [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) then i would recommend getting  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) for that extra ammo which will be converted to extra damage from the Chaingun buff. \n\nKeep buying items to increase damage/ATK speed, try to keep them in similar numbers however i like to get a little more atk speed than weapon power as it would result in more dps.\n [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and  [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) are the priority ones to have, you can use your initiative to buy for what you need. (if they have rein you can use  [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) which pairs nicely with  [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) as well as putting a lot of pressure on their tank)",
